<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential raises Rowan.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential raises Rowan.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities upgraded Rowan Cos Inc to buy from hold, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 5/8 at 25.</p>
</text>
